---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Puppy Starter Guide provides practical, no-nonsense guides and free tools for first-time puppy owners."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">About Puppy Starter Guide</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-stone mt-6 max-w-none">
      <p>
        Puppy Starter Guide exists for one reason: bringing home a puppy for the first time is
        overwhelming, and most advice online is either too vague or too commercial to actually
        help.
      </p>
      <p>
        We publish practical, step-by-step guides on the things every first-time puppy owner
        needs to figure out in the first weeks and months — feeding, potty training, sleep,
        crate training and daily routines — plus free tools like our
        <a href="/tools/puppy-schedule-generator/">Puppy Schedule Generator</a> to help you build
        a routine that fits your household.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're not veterinarians. Our guides are general information based on common training and
        care practices, not medical advice. Always talk to your vet about anything specific to
        your puppy's health, breed or behavior.
      </p>
      <p>
        Some of our content may include affiliate links to products or services we think are
        genuinely useful — see our
        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for details.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
